    "gamow_factor_derivation": "The Gamow factor is G = (1/hbar) * integral from r1 to r2 of sqrt(2 * mu * (V(r) - E)) dr.",
    "result": "P(E) = exp(-sqrt(E_G / E)), where E_G = 2 * mu * (pi * alpha * Z1 * Z2)^2 * c^2 is the Gamow energy and mu is the reduced mass."
